Hello everyone,

I am trying to assess the presence of phylogenetic signal in shape data using K-multiv. However, I am obtaining extremely low values of K (0.003) but with significant p-values. Of course, values close to 0 indicate the absene of phylogenetic signal but they are extremely low. Also happens with size data.
I wonder if this make sense in terms of no phylogenetic signal. Thanks in advance!
B-

PS.shape <- physignal(A=gdf2$Y3,phy=mytree,iter=9999, print.progress = TRUE)

